    "body": "Good catch! This `[[bin]]` section is indeed redundant.\n\nAccording to the official Cargo documentation on [target auto-discovery](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/cargo-targets.html#target-auto-discovery), when `src/main.rs` exists:\n- It's automatically used as the default binary target\n- The binary name defaults to the package name (`starship` in this case)\n- No explicit `[[bin]]` configuration is needed\n\nSince starship follows the standard project layout with `src/main.rs` and uses the package name as the binary name, removing this redundant configuration simplifies the `Cargo.toml` without changing any behavior.\n\nNice cleanup! 🎯",
